WEBVTT

00:19.800 --> 00:20.930
It's morning.

00:30.820 --> 00:32.220
Liar.

00:48.270 --> 00:54.690
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

00:48.270 --> 00:54.690
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

00:55.110 --> 01:01.740
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

00:55.110 --> 01:01.740
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:02.740 --> 01:09.000
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:02.740 --> 01:09.000
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:09.630 --> 01:16.720
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:09.630 --> 01:16.720
But I want to touch you now

01:16.930 --> 01:22.850
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:16.930 --> 01:22.850
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:23.260 --> 01:31.270
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:23.260 --> 01:31.270
An illusion showed me memories

01:32.340 --> 01:41.280
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:32.340 --> 01:41.280
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:41.450 --> 01:46.370
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:41.450 --> 01:46.370
Trembling with a foreboding

01:46.660 --> 01:54.710
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:46.660 --> 01:54.710
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

01:55.090 --> 02:04.430
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

01:55.090 --> 02:04.430
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:11.480 --> 02:17.090
Gray Sky

02:24.040 --> 02:27.000
She really did run away.

02:28.790 --> 02:31.540
Something happened with the Yaka. Now tell me what it was.

02:32.000 --> 02:33.040
Nothing happened.

02:33.790 --> 02:34.630
Liar.

02:34.960 --> 02:36.960
Stop trying to hide things from me!

02:39.130 --> 02:43.430
Such a spoiled princess causes too much trouble.

02:45.140 --> 02:46.180
Again?

02:47.890 --> 02:49.890
But it's been over a week now.

02:50.310 --> 02:53.400
Yet there's nowhere else she would go.

02:56.820 --> 02:58.530
Nothing's changed since yesterday.

02:58.940 --> 03:01.610
As I thought, she's not here.

03:02.110 --> 03:03.740
Then why is this blanket here?

03:04.490 --> 03:05.830
I don't know,

03:06.490 --> 03:09.290
but that doesn't prove that Matsuri-san was here.

03:09.830 --> 03:12.960
It's possible that someone else has been spending the night here.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.750
Then where did Matsuri go?

03:15.800 --> 03:17.250
Well...

03:20.130 --> 03:22.720
I don't think she's in this town anymore.

03:24.180 --> 03:28.640
She meant to disappear right in front of you...

03:35.270 --> 03:38.530
Well, are you late because the two of you were getting closer to each other?

03:38.860 --> 03:41.610
What's this? A date so early in the morning?

03:41.610 --> 03:43.360
Or did it end in the morning?

03:43.570 --> 03:45.410
Morimiya-kun said... he was living alone, right?

03:45.410 --> 03:47.910
Morimiya-kun said... he was living alone, right?

03:49.080 --> 03:50.540
Really?

03:50.790 --> 03:53.370
He's taking the punishment for being late by himself.

03:53.670 --> 03:55.500
Is that what you call devotion?

03:55.500 --> 03:57.130
Or is it passion?

03:57.130 --> 03:58.750
It's not like that.

04:14.060 --> 04:14.850
I told you, didn't I?

04:15.190 --> 04:17.270
I wasn't teasing you.

04:23.450 --> 04:25.070
What do you mean?

04:29.700 --> 04:31.410
I just got home!

04:31.700 --> 04:33.000
Good work.

04:33.620 --> 04:34.730
A reward.

04:36.380 --> 04:38.040
Thank you very much!

04:38.040 --> 04:39.670
I'll eat it modestly.

04:41.840 --> 04:43.920
Is that one okay?

04:44.840 --> 04:46.090
You pass.

04:46.090 --> 04:47.760
That's good.

04:47.760 --> 04:49.810
But you sure can be fussy over some things.

04:50.510 --> 04:52.680
The milk must be pasteurized,

04:52.680 --> 04:56.600
the tofu must be 100% soy beans, and the eggs...

04:56.850 --> 04:59.110
Because Yorito likes them like that.

05:00.320 --> 05:04.150
I hope Matsuri-san comes back soon.

05:04.530 --> 05:05.400
Why?

05:05.700 --> 05:09.070
Because then Yorito-san will come back earlier...

05:09.070 --> 05:12.490
...then the four of us can eat dinner together.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.040
Koyori.

05:15.210 --> 05:15.870
Yes?

05:16.210 --> 05:18.580
Do you think Matsuri-san will come back?

05:20.460 --> 05:23.460
I think I want her to come back.

05:23.880 --> 05:27.050
Seeing as how she liked it here so much.

05:28.430 --> 05:30.390
She liked it here?

05:30.680 --> 05:31.470
Yes.

05:31.760 --> 05:34.140
Because there's a sky here.

05:35.140 --> 05:36.310
A sky?

05:36.310 --> 05:38.020
That's what she said.

05:38.270 --> 05:41.110
Although I didn't really understand what she meant.

05:41.320 --> 05:43.320
It's probably Yorito-san's pictures.

05:52.790 --> 05:56.330
I wanted to show Matsuri the sky.

05:59.250 --> 06:00.380
Yorito...

07:05.820 --> 07:06.780
I'm home.

07:07.110 --> 07:08.860
Welcome back!

07:11.240 --> 07:12.870
What's going on?

07:13.660 --> 07:17.240
Aono-san said she wanted to do some redecorating.

07:17.870 --> 07:19.290
We're almost done.

07:19.710 --> 07:21.750
Go eat dinner, Yorito.

07:22.750 --> 07:23.880
Okay.

07:27.170 --> 07:28.670
Sis... where is this picture?

07:28.670 --> 07:29.920
Sis... where is this picture?

07:31.130 --> 07:32.130
I put it away.

07:32.890 --> 07:33.590
Why?

07:34.350 --> 07:35.720
For some reason.

07:36.100 --> 07:37.850
For some reason?

07:37.850 --> 07:40.060
That's a very important picture to me!

07:40.230 --> 07:41.190
Where is it?

07:43.150 --> 07:44.020
Sis!

07:47.230 --> 07:48.320
Please wait!

07:49.900 --> 07:54.200
Aono-san wanted to redecorate this place for your sake.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.490
My sake?

07:55.990 --> 07:56.700
Yes.

07:57.280 --> 08:00.080
Because if you see it, you'll remember...

08:01.330 --> 08:06.920
Aono-san doesn't want you to have painful memories, so...

08:06.920 --> 08:08.380
Why are they painful?

08:09.000 --> 08:10.590
Well...

08:10.590 --> 08:13.380
Why is remembering Matsuri painful?

08:13.590 --> 08:16.220
She's just gone out. She didn't say goodbye or anything!

08:16.760 --> 08:19.720
She'll probably be back soon, but you still...

08:19.720 --> 08:21.430
She won't come back.

08:24.310 --> 08:26.440
Even you... know that.

08:26.440 --> 08:27.440
Even you... know that.

08:35.700 --> 08:37.570
I'm truly sorry!

08:38.030 --> 08:42.040
I said something so impertinent to Yorito-san.

08:43.370 --> 08:45.500
Don't worry about it.

08:45.830 --> 08:46.830
But...

08:47.040 --> 08:50.250
I'm sure Yorito is thinking he is sorry, too.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.090
Forgive him.

08:53.380 --> 08:54.470
Aono-san.

08:55.430 --> 08:56.840
You did it for me.

08:57.470 --> 08:58.470
Thank you.

08:58.890 --> 09:00.060
I'm sorry.

09:00.850 --> 09:02.600
I'm so sorry.

09:08.860 --> 09:11.280
What am I doing?

09:18.620 --> 09:19.580
Sis...

09:20.450 --> 09:21.240
Here.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.420
I'm sorry... for getting mad all of a sudden.

09:30.420 --> 09:32.460
I'm sorry... for getting mad all of a sudden.

09:32.460 --> 09:35.470
I've made a deal with Koyori about buying her ice cream.

09:36.050 --> 09:38.140
Be sure to apologize later.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.220
All right.

09:40.140 --> 09:41.100
And...

09:42.600 --> 09:44.180
I'm also sorry.

09:44.810 --> 09:46.730
For doing that without asking.

09:48.230 --> 09:49.100
Sis...

09:52.980 --> 09:54.320
Hey... do you want to go for a quick walk?

09:54.320 --> 09:55.990
Hey... do you want to go for a quick walk?

09:56.900 --> 09:57.650
Fine.

10:02.200 --> 10:04.240
I think I understand.

10:05.040 --> 10:05.950
Understand what?

10:06.870 --> 10:08.920
What Matsuri said when she left.

10:09.210 --> 10:11.670
She meant that she probably won't come back.

10:12.460 --> 10:13.000
I see.

10:13.800 --> 10:16.630
But if I keep thinking like that...

10:16.880 --> 10:19.090
I may never see her again.

10:19.510 --> 10:26.020
So I checked the place where I met Matsuri, and the places where we walked together.

10:26.930 --> 10:28.390
This church is one of them.

10:28.730 --> 10:30.730
Matsuri once lived in there.

10:51.580 --> 10:52.540
Yorito...

11:03.100 --> 11:04.350
Perfect.

11:08.350 --> 11:09.350
Good morning.

11:09.810 --> 11:11.440
Go wash your face.

11:11.560 --> 11:12.690
Fine.

11:15.230 --> 11:17.280
This, this and this too!

11:17.610 --> 11:21.070
I can't get enough of this cucumber!

11:21.200 --> 11:24.280
That's why I told you not to come for breakfast every morning.

11:24.530 --> 11:25.870
And on top of that, with your sister.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.740
I'm truly sorry.

11:27.910 --> 11:31.330
It doesn't matter, does it? Aono-san invited us after all.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.710
Just listen to this sound...

11:35.590 --> 11:38.920
The trick is preparing the rice bran mixture well.

11:38.920 --> 11:40.220
That's right!

11:40.380 --> 11:42.970
Preparing it perfectly with the rice bran is also important.

11:43.970 --> 11:48.270
A proper woman has to be strong in places like that.

11:48.520 --> 11:50.560
That's being a proper woman?

11:50.770 --> 11:54.480
Mana-san has never been good at making nukazuke.

11:54.480 --> 11:57.020
I'd appreciate you not talking about stuff like that.

11:57.400 --> 11:58.110
Okay.

11:58.690 --> 11:59.990
It's already this late?

12:00.190 --> 12:01.360
Mana, let's go.

12:01.860 --> 12:02.490
Yeah.

12:04.870 --> 12:05.490
Wait.

12:06.070 --> 12:06.910
What is it?

12:07.280 --> 12:08.950
Do you remember... your promise?

12:08.950 --> 12:10.080
Do you remember... your promise?

12:10.080 --> 12:11.080
Don't worry.

12:11.410 --> 12:12.580
It's this afternoon, right?

12:13.120 --> 12:14.040
I'm off.

12:22.720 --> 12:24.130
Elementary school student.

12:25.140 --> 12:26.220
Old lady.

12:41.690 --> 12:42.570
No...

12:43.110 --> 12:43.950
No...

12:44.450 --> 12:45.160
No...

12:45.610 --> 12:46.490
No...

12:46.990 --> 12:47.740
No...

12:48.240 --> 12:48.830
No...

12:49.160 --> 12:49.700
No-

12:53.330 --> 12:54.670
Um... I also need to go to school soon.

12:54.670 --> 12:56.960
Um... I also need to go to school soon.

13:05.090 --> 13:07.720
There's no doubt about it!

13:07.970 --> 13:11.720
Everyday he's waiting for that girl in front of the restaurant.

13:12.220 --> 13:15.190
Her real mother must've taken her away!

13:15.440 --> 13:18.310
When did they become father and daughter?

13:19.110 --> 13:24.490
That bearded man must have some strange past with a strange woman!

13:24.780 --> 13:29.280
So you're saying they got married, had a child, and then split up?

13:29.570 --> 13:31.950
There's no other possible explanation, is there?

13:32.160 --> 13:34.080
I think there is...

13:34.290 --> 13:36.080
No, there isn't!

13:36.290 --> 13:40.290
Because I heard that girl talking about her mother!

13:40.840 --> 13:44.090
She said to the bearded dandy guy with a serious look:

13:44.510 --> 13:46.840
"Something happened between you and Yaka, didn't it?"

13:47.260 --> 13:48.180
Yaka?

13:48.470 --> 13:49.340
Yes!

13:49.680 --> 13:51.510
It's the mother's name!

13:52.010 --> 13:52.430
Right?

13:52.560 --> 13:53.180
Right?

13:53.350 --> 13:55.980
Doesn't it all make sense now?

13:56.140 --> 13:57.600
That woman named Yaka...

13:57.600 --> 13:59.860
It's been a month now.

14:09.910 --> 14:11.160
So then today-

14:13.290 --> 14:14.240
Sis!

14:14.830 --> 14:17.370
Did you walk all the way to school just to see us?

14:17.790 --> 14:19.830
I was... in the area.

14:20.330 --> 14:21.590
In the area...

14:24.590 --> 14:25.760
In those clothes?

14:29.300 --> 14:30.510
There's no need to stare.

14:30.720 --> 14:33.430
You finally got out...

14:33.430 --> 14:35.680
It's a pity the weather's so bad.

14:36.020 --> 14:39.060
Not really. I actually think this is nice weather.

14:40.520 --> 14:41.150
Well...

14:41.810 --> 14:43.770
Yeah... bye...

14:45.440 --> 14:46.610
See you...

14:49.150 --> 14:50.610
Nice weather?

14:56.040 --> 14:57.540
How's this one?

14:58.790 --> 15:00.170
In that case...

15:02.710 --> 15:04.500
Then how about...?

15:06.210 --> 15:06.960
This one.

15:10.720 --> 15:11.760
Um...

15:12.800 --> 15:13.970
I'm joking.

15:15.180 --> 15:16.720
Are you sure it's all right to not buy anything?

15:17.520 --> 15:19.680
I never intended to buy anything.

15:19.980 --> 15:21.190
Then why?

15:21.810 --> 15:24.020
I wanted to go... to the place you always go to.

15:24.020 --> 15:26.690
I wanted to go... to the place you always go to.

15:35.450 --> 15:36.450
Sis?

15:40.250 --> 15:43.120
I want to see far into the distance.

15:45.750 --> 15:49.010
I don't think you'll be able to see much with this rain.

15:49.260 --> 15:53.590
But I'll still be able to see farther than I can from down there.

15:59.520 --> 16:02.060
As I thought, the mist is terrible.

16:02.940 --> 16:04.310
But it's still pretty.

16:04.900 --> 16:06.650
There are colors in our world.

16:07.020 --> 16:07.860
Colors?

16:08.400 --> 16:09.990
Green grass.

16:10.570 --> 16:12.240
Blue roofs.

16:13.070 --> 16:14.410
Red boats.

16:15.070 --> 16:16.780
All of them have color.

16:17.780 --> 16:20.700
That is an amazing thing.

16:21.200 --> 16:25.420
A beautiful world that you can't see during the night.

16:28.000 --> 16:31.510
When was the last time we went out like this?

16:32.800 --> 16:33.800
Who knows?

16:34.220 --> 16:36.970
It's because you were always in the hospital.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.890
I guess.

16:39.180 --> 16:41.470
It's been quite a long time, I think.

16:41.980 --> 16:43.140
Before this...

16:44.190 --> 16:45.400
Before... this...

16:45.400 --> 16:46.190
Before... this...

17:17.640 --> 17:19.680
You'll catch a cold.

17:20.970 --> 17:22.310
Thank you.

17:27.850 --> 17:29.730
You're pretty wet.

17:30.690 --> 17:32.070
Let's hurry home.

17:38.820 --> 17:40.280
Again?

17:41.030 --> 17:44.200
We promised to go to Mana's restaurant.

17:44.750 --> 17:46.960
That was if we had time, remember?

17:48.630 --> 17:50.290
It can't be helped, I guess.

17:51.090 --> 17:52.170
Then...

17:55.010 --> 17:56.170
Wait here for a sec.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.390
Let's see, a towel, a towel...

18:08.810 --> 18:10.190
Um...

18:12.190 --> 18:12.980
Found it!

18:17.360 --> 18:18.110
It's expensive!

18:31.290 --> 18:32.250
Matsuri!

18:36.380 --> 18:37.220
Wait!

18:39.380 --> 18:40.260
Matsuri!

18:40.260 --> 18:40.800
Matsu-

18:42.720 --> 18:43.640
Sis...

18:45.350 --> 18:46.520
You're not allowed to go.

18:48.100 --> 18:49.100
Don't go.

18:49.520 --> 18:50.520
Don't go!

18:54.900 --> 18:55.570
I'm sorry!

19:10.000 --> 19:11.290
Matsuri!

19:22.010 --> 19:22.930
Yorito...

19:30.890 --> 19:31.940
Why?!

19:33.480 --> 19:34.400
Matsuri!

19:36.320 --> 19:37.070
Wait!

19:59.920 --> 20:01.220
Why?

20:01.630 --> 20:02.970
I promise,

20:03.760 --> 20:06.260
I won't appear in front of you two ever again.

20:07.600 --> 20:08.970
Why?

20:36.790 --> 20:37.750
Don't come any closer!

20:40.760 --> 20:41.710
Why?

20:42.470 --> 20:43.550
You're not allowed to.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.930
Please.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.720
Give me a reason!

20:47.640 --> 20:49.510
Please... go home.

20:49.510 --> 20:50.430
Please... go home.

20:50.430 --> 20:51.270
No!

20:52.560 --> 20:57.270
I still haven't fulfilled the promise.

20:58.190 --> 21:00.320
I still haven't shown you the sky!

21:01.730 --> 21:03.190
Let's go home together... okay?

21:03.190 --> 21:03.860
Let's go home together... okay?

21:05.110 --> 21:06.360
Thank you.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.780
I'm very happy.

21:09.490 --> 21:10.410
But...

21:11.700 --> 21:12.870
I can't.

21:13.750 --> 21:14.660
Because...

21:15.330 --> 21:16.210
You're...

21:16.750 --> 21:17.920
You're...

21:20.630 --> 21:21.550
Let's go home.

21:24.470 --> 21:25.380
Yorito.

21:29.180 --> 21:30.390
Yorito.

21:46.700 --> 21:47.860
Yori... to...

22:15.210 --> 22:23.880
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:15.210 --> 22:23.880
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:24.300 --> 22:33.060
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:24.300 --> 22:33.060
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:33.180 --> 22:37.480
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:33.180 --> 22:37.480
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:37.770 --> 22:42.570
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:37.770 --> 22:42.570
Even though I stand alone

22:43.820 --> 22:49.330
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:43.820 --> 22:49.330
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:49.490 --> 22:53.830
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

22:49.490 --> 22:53.830
When people go into slumber

22:54.040 --> 23:01.750
mata au hi no negai tsumugeru deshou  ai no ito

22:54.040 --> 23:01.750
Their wish to unite can be woven. The thread of love

23:02.050 --> 23:12.180
yasashisa wo sasou  otogibanashi anata kara osowatta no yo

23:02.050 --> 23:12.180
Fairy tales that elicit kindness I learned that from you

23:12.350 --> 23:22.110
modorimashou  sotto ano koro no omoi ni

23:12.350 --> 23:22.110
Let us return gently to the memories of those times

23:31.840 --> 23:46.860
Next Time

23:31.840 --> 23:46.860
Indelible Thoughts

23:32.430 --> 23:34.390
That bearded man came into the restaurant again today.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.640
Oh, that bearded man!

23:36.850 --> 23:39.100
The bearded man who frightens away my sorrow!

23:39.100 --> 23:42.400
The bearded man whose manliness fills my heart to the brim!

23:43.060 --> 23:45.610
I wish I'll be able to meet that bearded man again tomorrow!
